## Video drivers/hardware acceleration. Please avoid translating 'OpenGL' and 'ANGLE'.

preferences-video-driver = Video drayveri
preferences-video-driver-opengl-mac = OpenGL (Macʼda tavsiya qilinadi)
preferences-video-driver-software-mac = Dasturiy taʼminot (tavsiya etilmaydi)
preferences-video-driver-opengl-other = OpenGL (tezroq, lekin muammolar tuğdirişi mumkin)
preferences-video-driver-software-other = Dasturiy taʼminot (sekin işlaydi)
preferences-video-driver-angle = ANGLE (OpenGLʼdan yaxşiroq işlaşi mumkin)
preferences-video-driver-default = birlamçi
